<section id="shila-faq-v33" class="shila-faq">
  <h2 class="shila-faq-heading">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</h2>
  <details class="shila-faq-item"><summary>How quickly should I expect to feel something?</summary><div class="shila-faq-answer">In my own practice, roughly 70% of patients describe a noticeable shift in afternoon energy and sleep depth within the first 7 to 10 days. Recovery and joint comfort shifts typically land between days 14 and 28. The visible tissue, skin, and biomarker changes — the changes that show up in a mirror or a panel — typically arrive between week 6 and week 12. The full ninety-day arc is what we measure against.</div></details>
  <details class="shila-faq-item"><summary>Is the protocol safe to start at my age?</summary><div class="shila-faq-answer">The three compounds in the AgeAura Pure Protocol — Urolithin A, NMN + TMG, and the Longevity Peptide complex — have been studied in human clinical trials in adults from age 40 through age 85. The Shanghai-affiliated programs work routinely with patients well into their seventies. If you're on prescription medication — particularly blood thinners or immunosuppressants — please discuss with your physician before starting.</div></details>
  <details class="shila-faq-item"><summary>Why are all three compounds necessary? Can I just take one?</summary><div class="shila-faq-answer">You can — and many people do — and they get partial results. But the science is now clear: mitophagy, NAD+ restoration, and peptide signaling are three different layers of the aging process. Addressing one without the other two is like cleaning an engine but never refilling the oil. The full protocol is engineered to work as a stack, in sequence, every day.</div></details>
  <details class="shila-faq-item"><summary>What if it doesn't work for me?</summary><div class="shila-faq-answer">Run the full three-layer AgeAura Pure Protocol for 90 days. If you don't see the shifts I describe in this letter, just email <a href="mailto:support@wellnessnest.co">support@wellnessnest.co</a> with your order number. We process a full refund within 48 hours — no forms, no "store credit," no questions asked. We can offer this guarantee because, in practice, our return rate runs under 2%.</div></details>
  <details class="shila-faq-item"><summary>Are the peptides legal in the United States?</summary><div class="shila-faq-answer">Yes. The AgeAura Pure Longevity Peptide complex is formulated entirely from peptide sequences and structural analogs that are legal for sale and consumption in the United States. We do not import any compound that is not compliant with current U.S. regulatory standards.</div></details>
  <details class="shila-faq-item"><summary>Can I take this with my existing supplements?</summary><div class="shila-faq-answer">In most cases, yes — Urolithin A, NMN + TMG, and the peptide complex are designed to integrate with the foundational supplement stack most longevity-aware patients are already running (vitamin D, magnesium, omega-3, etc.). The protocol replaces, and is significantly more effective than, the single-compound NMN and Urolithin A products most patients arrive with.</div></details>
  <details class="shila-faq-item"><summary>Should I talk to my doctor first?</summary><div class="shila-faq-answer">We always recommend speaking with your healthcare provider about any supplement you add to your routine — especially if you're managing a chronic condition, on blood thinners, or scheduled for surgery. Bring this page with you. The mechanism is straightforward and your physician will recognize the compound names from the recent literature.</div></details>
  <details class="shila-faq-item"><summary>How do I cancel my subscription?</summary><div class="shila-faq-answer">Bundle tiers (Buy 2 Get 1, Buy 3 Get 2, Buy 6 Get 6) are one-time orders at the listed price. If you choose the automatic refill option, you can cancel anytime from your account with two clicks. No phone trees. No retention scripts.</div></details>
  <details class="shila-faq-item"><summary>Do you ship internationally?</summary><div class="shila-faq-answer">Currently we ship to the United States and Canada within 48 hours from our North American fulfillment partner. International shipping (UK, EU, Australia) is in private beta — email support@wellnessnest.co to be added to the international waitlist.</div></details>
</section>
